                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>According to the Log, <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg845">p.
                        845</ref>, Roosevelt conferred with Mount-batten for half an hour beginning
                    at 5 p.m. No record of the discussion has been found.</p>
